@host = http://localhost:8080
@businessId = 1
@serviceId = 1
@employeeId = 1
@clientId = 1

### 1a. Retrieve all services by Business ID (path variable)
GET {{host}}/api/businesses/{{businessId}}/services
Accept: application/json

### 1b. Retrieve all services by Business ID (query parameter)
GET {{host}}/api/services?businessId={{businessId}}
Accept: application/json

### 1c. Services - Non-existent Business (Expects 400 or 404 Entity Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/businesses/99999/services
Accept: application/json

### 2a. Retrieve all employees by Business ID (path variable)
GET {{host}}/api/businesses/{{businessId}}/employees
Accept: application/json

### 2b. Retrieve all employees by Business ID (query parameter)
GET {{host}}/api/employees?businessId={{businessId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2c. Employees - Non-existent Business (Expects 400 or 404 Entity Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/businesses/99999/employees
Accept: application/json

### 3a. Create appointment with registered client
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessId": {{businessId}},
  "serviceId": {{serviceId}},
  "employeeId": {{employeeId}},
  "clientId": {{clientId}},
  "date": "2026-11-23",
  "startTime": "10:00:00",
  "paymentMethod": "PHYSICAL",
  "status": "CONFIRMED",
  "clientNote": "First time booking with registered client"
}

### 3b. Create appointment with guest / new client (name + email/phone)
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessId": {{businessId}},
  "serviceId": {{serviceId}},
  "employeeId": {{employeeId}},
  "clientName": "Ana Popescu",
  "clientEmail": "ana.popescu@example.com",
  "clientPhone": "0712345678",
  "date": "2026-11-23",
  "startTime": "11:30:00",
  "paymentMethod": "PHYSICAL",
  "status": "CONFIRMED",
  "clientNote": "Guest client haircut request"
}

### 3c. Create appointment - Validation Error: missing serviceId (Expects 400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessId": {{businessId}},
  "employeeId": {{employeeId}},
  "clientId": {{clientId}},
  "date": "2026-11-23",
  "startTime": "10:00:00"
}

### 3d. Create appointment - Validation Error: missing client info (Expects 400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessId": {{businessId}},
  "serviceId": {{serviceId}},
  "employeeId": {{employeeId}},
  "date": "2026-11-23",
  "startTime": "10:00:00"
}

### 3e. Create appointment - Non-existent service (Expects 400 or 404 Entity Not Found)
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessId": {{businessId}},
  "serviceId": 99999,
  "employeeId": {{employeeId}},
  "clientId": {{clientId}},
  "date": "2026-11-23",
  "startTime": "10:00:00"
}
